  <step>
    <name>const-map</name>
    <type>Constant</type>
    <description/>
    <distribute>Y</distribute>
    <custom_distribution/>
    <copies>1</copies>
    <partitioning>
      <method>none</method>
      <schema_name/>
    </partitioning>
    <fields>
      <field>
        <name>run_instruction</name>
        <type>String</type>
        <format/>
        <currency/>
        <decimal/>
        <group/>
        <nullif>You summarize one part of a long company annual report. The part can start or end in the middle of a section.
Write three to five sentences in plain text, with no heading and no list. Keep every figure, name and date that matters, exactly as the text gives it. Do not add anything the text does not say.</nullif>
        <length>-1</length>
